# Not needed at runtime - the deployed API reads from Supabase, not the
# CSV corpus (that's only used by src/db/import_corpus.py, a one-off local
# script). Excluded to keep the Python function bundle smaller.
#
# Leading slashes anchor these to the repo root - unanchored "data/" would
# also match src/data/ (a real package the API imports at runtime), which
# is exactly the bug that broke the first deploy attempt.
/data/
/tests/
